{
  "description": "External alterations, including the reconstruction of the 1993 kitchen extension as a painted timber and metal orangery; replacement of rear windows, doors and courtyard screens with traditional painted timber joinery, including box sash windows; laying of natural sandstone paving to the courtyard and terrace; reinstatement of scribed stucco; repair of the rear terrace and walkway, including alterations to the existing cast metal balustrade and installation of painted cast iron rainwater goods; replacement of vault doors with traditional painted timber doors, including a louvred door to Vault 3; replanting of the front lightwell and repair and relaying of existing York stone paving; rebuilding of the front lightwell services route at reduced size; replacement of the existing communal boiler flue with a smaller flue; lining of the vaults with a reversible membrane and installation of quarry tile flooring; and installation of an air-source heat pump within an acoustically lined Vault 3, with associated louvred ventilation.  (Linked to 26/07905/LBC)",
